WEBVTT

00:00:58.179 --> 00:01:00.765
we give up and we don’t measure.

00:01:01.933 --> 00:01:03.267
And when we do measure,

00:01:03.267 --> 00:01:06.479
we are reduced to relying on estimations

00:01:06.479 --> 00:01:07.980
and conversion factors.

00:01:09.148 --> 00:01:14.445
The consequence is we end up working
with highly incomplete

00:01:14.445 --> 00:01:17.198
and inaccurate estimations
of our emissions.

00:01:18.407 --> 00:01:21.994
Often we have a margin of error
of 30 to 60 percent.

00:01:22.703 --> 00:01:28.167
This means targets
and action plans are set

00:01:28.167 --> 00:01:30.253
based on inaccurate data.